    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Requests",
     "texto": [
      "Add **ください** to the て form: **まって ください** (please wait). You have to learn each verb's group: **います** (to be/exist) → **いて**, but **かいます** (to buy) → **かって**. **きます** (to come) is irregular; **きます** (to put on clothes) follows the group 2 pattern."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
