    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Knowing how to do something: できます",
     "texto": [
      "**できます** means «can, to know how to do», and the skill takes **が**: **にほんご が できます** (I know Japanese), **うんてん が できます** (I know how to drive). Negative: **できません**.",
      "To say someone does something well: **じょうず です**: **にほんご が じょうず です ね** (you speak Japanese well).",
      "If someone says it to you, the polite reply is to play it down: **いいえ、 まだまだ です** (no, I still have a long way to go)."
     ],
